--
-- New race / class pairs: Human Hunter, Undead Hunter.
-- GENERATED by client-patches/race-class/build_race_class.py together with the client DBCs
-- (CharBaseInfo, CharStartOutfit, SkillRaceClassInfo -> patch-enGB-4) - edit the builder, not this file.
--
-- Enough to create the character and play it: start position, starting weapon skills, action bar,
-- starting items. Not here yet: hunter trainers and class quests in Northshire and Deathknell.
-- Everything is read at startup: restart the worldserver.
